                                "sense_id": "4b5fb5b0-2b6f-3b50-83ad-8847b9a63305",
                                "text": "Ze had een aristocratische houding die veel mensen imponerend vonden.",
                                "translation": "She had an aristocratic demeanor that many found imposing.",
                                "english": "She had an aristocratic demeanor that many found imposing."
